      "body": "Thanks for the suggestion, I agree with it. Applied in a second commit (756afe14b5): each sub-case now gets its own scope, and the shared setup stays outside. If you look at that commit's diff with whitespace ignored, the only real change is the braces. A nice side effect: with the scopes in place, the original mistake wouldn't even compile.",
